@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - UC11 Kiem duyet ban thuyet minh

actor "Admin / ContentAdmin" as Actor
participant "Presentation Layer\nWebAdminUI - MediaLibraryPage tab Ban thuyet minh" as UI
participant "Business Logic Layer\nNarrationsController + NarrationDraftService" as Business
participant "Data Access Layer\nApplicationDbContext" as DataAccess
database "Database" as Database

Actor -> UI: Mo draft Pending va xem noi dung
UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau doc narration
Business -> DataAccess: Doc draft va thong tin nguoi gui
DataAccess -> Database: Doc NarrationDraft va User
Database --> DataAccess: Tra du lieu
DataAccess --> Business: Tra draft
Business --> UI: Hien thi noi dung

opt Admin chinh sua noi dung thuyet minh
  Actor -> UI: Sua noi dung text trong modal xem noi dung
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau cap nhat text
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen, do dai va trang thai draft
  alt Noi dung hop le
    Business -> Business: Xem ngon ngu vua sua la nguon dong bo
    Business -> Business: Tao lai MP3 cho ngon ngu vua sua
    loop Moi ngon ngu active khac
      Business -> Business: Dich lai title/text va tao lai MP3
      Business -> DataAccess: Upsert NarrationDraft va AudioTrack
      DataAccess -> Database: Ghi Status AudioGenerated, GeneratedAudioTrack va metadata audio
      Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    end
    Business -> DataAccess: Cap nhat NarrationDraft nguon va AudioTrack nguon
    DataAccess -> Database: Ghi Status AudioGenerated, text va metadata audio
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra draft da cap nhat va audio moi
    UI -> UI: Lam moi danh sach thuyet minh va am thanh
  else Noi dung khong hop le
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
end

alt Admin chon Duyet
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau approve
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen va trang thai Pending
  alt Hop le
    Business -> DataAccess: Ghi Translating, reviewer va thoi diem
    DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat NarrationDraft
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business -> Business: Dua draft vao hang doi dich va tao TTS
    Business --> UI: Tra draft dang xu ly
    UI -> UI: Tu dong refetch bang thuyet minh va am thanh
  else Sai quyen, khong ton tai hoac sai trang thai
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
else Admin chon Tu choi
  Actor -> UI: Nhap ly do
  UI -> Business: Gui yeu cau reject
  Business -> Business: Kiem tra quyen, trang thai va ly do
  alt Hop le
    Business -> DataAccess: Ghi Rejected va ly do
    DataAccess -> Database: Cap nhat NarrationDraft
    Database --> DataAccess: Xac nhan
    Business --> UI: Tra draft bi tu choi
  else Thieu ly do hoac sai trang thai
    Business --> UI: Tra thong bao loi
  end
end
UI --> Actor: Cap nhat danh sach hoac hien thi loi
@enduml
